# SASL is configured but the server has no CAP at all: it answers CAP LS
# with 421 and registers us. Say that SASL did not happen.
= auth sasl-plain
= account-password hunter2
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :old.example 421 * CAP :Unknown command
< :old.example 001 textual :Welcome to OldNet textual
? notice SASL failed: the server does not offer SASL
? registered textual
